{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:07 2026-05-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:14 2026-05-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:14 2026-05-18 HKT</p><p>東涌發生致命車禍。今日（18日）清晨6時23分，警方接獲報案，指一名年約60歲男途人於文東路近映灣園及健東路交界，被一輛的士撞倒後一度被困，並陷入昏迷。救援人員趕至，消防及救護員將傷者救出，急送北大嶼山醫院，但經搶救後不治。</p><p>現場消息稱，當時事主由的士車頭右至左橫過馬路，詎料被的士撞倒。所見事後馬路遺下一頂帽和一隻錶，警方在場度尺，正調查意外成因。</p><img alt=\"的士撞斃過路男。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0649f842b9da8495bc13c0f099b5a85b/2026-05/2_2_41.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2586b1d8dc1151bcd516cd850cb77e8f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260518_090622146_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9a653fb36b0dd6ab5f8137d1a364bd0c/2026-05/3_0_32.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/02c730ef5462153e8cd5f3c589104d82/2026-05/1_8_48.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場度尺調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ea71bb7ffbb4c460ccade0f4aeada961/2026-05/4_5_34.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f66bd6a5d132228e91ca00295ceb295/2026-05/5_0_26.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬路遺下一頂帽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8363c64e0745f1cf1f4ab55ad3a455a8/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260518_091446066.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-18T01:39:13.361045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}